{"unit_id": "virggle__dsh-shutdown-after-task#card-zh", "repo": "virggle/dsh-shutdown-after-task", "commit": "2ef4cd16a003013caaf11b3650f3922400945185", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-shutdown-after-task**（DSH Web 插件）：在 Windows 上于 DSH 任务结束后按需关机。它通过 `webServer.tapIndex` 注入可拖动的网页按钮，并监听根会话状态来判断任务是否完成。主要功能包括手动开启或关闭关机模式、等待所有根会话空闲、成功完成后启动可取消的倒计时，以及新任务开始时撤销倒计时；界面还可避让其他角落弹窗。适合运行长时间任务后希望电脑自动关机的 Windows 用户。需要在 Windows 上使用；倒计时和余量可配置。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:313-330", "index.js:376-418", "index.js:446-492"]}
{"unit_id": "virggle__dsh-shutdown-after-task#card-en", "repo": "virggle/dsh-shutdown-after-task", "commit": "2ef4cd16a003013caaf11b3650f3922400945185", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "**dsh-shutdown-after-task** (DSH Web plugin): schedules Windows shutdown after DSH tasks finish. A draggable button arms the feature; idle root sessions start a cancellable countdown. New work interrupts it. Countdown timing is configurable.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:313-330", "index.js:376-418", "index.js:446-492"]}
