{"unit_id": "virggle__dsh-shutdown-after-task#feature-1", "repo": "virggle/dsh-shutdown-after-task", "commit": "2ef4cd16a003013caaf11b3650f3922400945185", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-shutdown-after-task** 的功能「完成后关机」：任务完成后关机模式默认关闭，用户可用网页浮动按钮手动开启；所有根会话空闲且符合成功条件时，插件调用 Windows 关机命令启动倒计时。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:333-338", "index.js:398-435"]}
{"unit_id": "virggle__dsh-shutdown-after-task#feature-2", "repo": "virggle/dsh-shutdown-after-task", "commit": "2ef4cd16a003013caaf11b3650f3922400945185", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-shutdown-after-task** 的功能「取消倒计时」：倒计时期间，界面显示剩余时间和取消按钮；点击后发送取消操作，撤销待执行的系统关机并关闭模式。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:158-167", "index.js:398-415", "index.js:446-462"]}
{"unit_id": "virggle__dsh-shutdown-after-task#feature-3", "repo": "virggle/dsh-shutdown-after-task", "commit": "2ef4cd16a003013caaf11b3650f3922400945185", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-shutdown-after-task** 的功能「新任务中断」：倒计时期间若根会话开始运行，插件会自动撤销本次关机并保留已开启的模式，之后仍可等待下一批任务完成。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:419-425"]}
{"unit_id": "virggle__dsh-shutdown-after-task#feature-4", "repo": "virggle/dsh-shutdown-after-task", "commit": "2ef4cd16a003013caaf11b3650f3922400945185", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-shutdown-after-task** 的功能「可拖动按钮与避让」：用户可拖动网页浮动按钮并将位置保存在浏览器本地；检测到其他可点击的固定弹窗遮挡时，按钮会暂时移开。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:102-134", "index.js:202-268"]}
{"unit_id": "virggle__dsh-shutdown-after-task#caveat-1", "repo": "virggle/dsh-shutdown-after-task", "commit": "2ef4cd16a003013caaf11b3650f3922400945185", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "**dsh-shutdown-after-task** 使用前须知：关机功能只在 Windows 平台启用；其他平台插件保持惰性。模式状态保存在运行内存中，DSH 重启后默认关闭。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:319-322", "index.js:333-338"]}
